! FOWC []:  Finite Orbit Width Correction to the neoclassical 
!     ion heat conductivity
! Usage: XI=...+FOWC*HNCHI+
!   Z.Lin, W.M.Tang, W.W.Lee, Phys. Plasmas, Vol.4, No.5, May 1997, p.1707
!   (Pereverzev 8-Oct-97)
! for trapped particle fraction see "fml/tpf"
YX0=2820*(BTOR*MU(j)*ZMAIN(j))**2/(RTOR*TI(j)*AMAIN(j))
YX0 = YX0*RHO(j)**3
FOWC = 1.-(1.+YX0)*exp(-YX0)
